            <div xml:id="d904-a1">

                <pb facs="1077" n="981" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg981"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">draft of telegram</hi>.</head>
                <p>Constructor Hobson and seven seamen, Montague, Charette, Murphy, Deignan,
                    Phillips, Kelly, Clausen, on the U. S. ship <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Merrimac</hi>, when sunk at Santiago de Cuba, now held prisoners by
                    Spaniards. United States desires to learn through Her Majesty’s consul at
                    Santiago de Cuba how prisoners are treated as to food, exercise, and attention,
                    and especially whether they are kept in places in line of fire in military
                    operations.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
